<title>HONG KONG: HK's Boto issues 125.4 mln shrs at HK$1.28 each.</title>
<headline>HK's Boto issues 125.4 mln shrs at HK$1.28 each.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Artificial Christmas tree maker Boto International Holdings Ltd said on Friday it issued 125.4 million new shares, or 25 percent of its enlarged share capital, at HK$1.28 each in an initial public offer (IPO) in Hong Kong.</p>
</text>
